{
  "slug": "pm2nbwc2kri",
  "title": "药王谷",
  "html": "<p class=\"ws-p\">看前须知：本攻略仍然可能会因为时间推移版本更新导致攻略更新，本文路线好人线杀人线攻略以及奖 励全览，若未来版本变动有后续路线可等待其他大佬写攻略，真心感谢每一位提出攻略和指点的大佬， 由衷感谢(by:林少谨)</p><p class=\"ws-p\">普通黑木崖，进去先杀东方和杨顺序随意，路上弟子可以杀，先回来杀另外两个堂主(青龙堂，风雷堂)，  最后回到白虎堂大厅上官云对你bb两句(他他妈直接跑路你给路打油)，此时解锁药王谷，完成副本，点击 江湖即可进入药王谷</p><p class=\"ws-p\">进入药王谷有NPC拦门，缴纳一金即可任意通行</p><p class=\"ws-p\">缴纳1金后进入后来到醉仙楼点击二楼</p><p class=\"ws-p\">店小二说被贵客包下来了</p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/N8PLbqnJYo6k4nxnGosclhwOn0c.png\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"389\" height=\"53\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">然后在店小二身上购买一瓶酒即可进入二楼</p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/YUjGbAfZzoRWqaxHymBcn2sqnzd.png\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"307\" height=\"36\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">进入二楼后看见上官云，此时上官云会对你说话(这一步必须做，要不然后面没法进错房间触发上官云对 话线)</p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/U5lhbmWR6oqJM6x0NmbcEDCBnPb.png\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"422\" height=\"85\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">等上官云对话结束后，来到青石头客栈找店小二住店，缴纳一金后装备药王神篇</p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/CxKubiuZToAcVfxoWujccrlunid.png\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"426\" height=\"105\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/HEWObFaBnonsFpx3P30caqLIn2c.png\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"372\" height=\"48\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">此时点击店小二住店进入客栈客房出现下述提示：</p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/PMAvbYkN7ofpLJxQmBMchAaknvb.png\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"446\" height=\"36\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">此时点击睡觉，会提示你呼呼睡着了</p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/K1sfbQ7CZov3yKxBfx6cawevnSb.png\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"468\" height=\"33\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">稍等一会出剧情；当出现逃走了(画框的对话时)，请立即点停止睡觉，点击追上去<span class=\"is-bold\">(从现在开始的通用线 流程线请手速加快，之后的任何操作导致没追到小乞丐，那么</span><span class=\"is-bold\">重新去找上官云</span><span class=\"is-bold\">重走一遍)</span></p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/GHPVb1lBSoEK92xNtLNcKh47nUf.jpg\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"448\" height=\"139\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">此时你在屋顶会出现如下提示</p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/Pdqub4bZsop1rlxIp9EcbwSKnId.jpg\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"446\" height=\"106\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/Zk3BbVKYHotsbpxUVfFcyxEtnBg.png\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"258\" height=\"45\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">向上点击一步屋顶后出现如下提示后，点击动作栏<span class=\"is-bold\">跳下去</span></p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/QZAcboGmtob7EOx6LCwcy3DGnOb.png\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"298\" height=\"35\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/TbZIbhoDcoVLeNxGooWczueDn9d.png\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"66\" height=\"36\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">你会看到上官云在睡觉觉，出现提示你看到上官云呼呼大睡（如果你在这呆久了上官云睡醒了，或者是 因为呆太久回去没房顶了，那么退出副本重来通用路线流程）</p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/MouZbdRjKotjb4xpV1mcAEUGn3b.png\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"358\" height=\"131\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">点击木柜，打开木柜出现如下提示</p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/X6vEb0QdRoSNWYxo9gOcOHavnVd.png\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"59\" height=\"44\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/QJaAbk0RBomPdaxZ5NKc33D7nTh.png\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"363\" height=\"105\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">之后你的地图是这样</p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/KA5ObHMMRo1ympxINHTcib7Vnje.jpg\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"445\" height=\"63\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">迅速点击青石客栈回到房顶，再次点击向上的屋顶往前追击(只需要点击一次)</p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/G5xQbyQxNofa2GxdxS9csNOkn9d.png\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"299\" height=\"41\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">此时出现，点击动作栏的动作<span class=\"is-bold\">“跳下去”</span>后你位于，向上一步走点击破败古庙遇见小乞丐，弹出</p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/DFMObEpQ0oEd3IxVbFwc3E8xnkh.png\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"436\" height=\"177\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">对话，点击”<span class=\"is-bold\">告诉我如何去药王谷</span>“</p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/FT3sbBfyvoRrTIxMx0AciAJlnRg.jpg\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"444\" height=\"86\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">弹出提示</p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/UdfhbsxGao0hraxZyT8cMVDyn1d.jpg\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"449\" height=\"49\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">继续点击<span class=\"is-bold\">”不用担心我有入谷资格“</span>后弹出新提示：</p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/QtEKbiBY3opRpWxjb74cfsSMnzb.jpg\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"446\" height=\"39\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">前往松木亭，遇见程灵素(就是小乞丐)等待几秒程灵素与你对话</p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/XUa3b7rOPoireRx7dhVcuXA8ngf.jpg\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"444\" height=\"97\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/JjpzbKwaCoIDQsxiEfqcO3fdn3b.jpg\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"449\" height=\"76\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">至此通用线路结束，可继续顺下做好人线杀人线，当然你想停止了不做等之后做都可以，之后的步骤就 顺着好人线杀人线做即可</p><p class=\"ws-p\">此时位于松木亭等待程灵素对话</p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/LVOebDH39oNvX7xhoIXcGQfAnNe.jpg\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"444\" height=\"97\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/WxPhbqo3goGoFTxNs21crPptnMc.jpg\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"449\" height=\"76\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">点击出发后进入古林：</p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/BAfub52NqoVXpvxdm7acse0HnUe.jpg\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"447\" height=\"102\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">此时就可以瞎走了，乱走一通，等待程灵素对话直至出现：<span class=\"is-bold\">你来带路</span></p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/SGDSbTpXrom2tLxhLpMcfkQDn7e.jpg\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"447\" height=\"264\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">点击你来带路弹出下一个剧情：</p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/DLYkbQNJrorkifxZ81scWTdqnSe.jpg\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"444\" height=\"97\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">玩家目前处于此地图：</p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/C3O3bQFV7oKBqfxQuuqc33U2nyc.jpg\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"446\" height=\"89\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">点击进入<span class=\"is-bold\">古药林</span>，此时动作栏有采药，点击采药即可，等待出现<span class=\"is-bold\">走远了</span>对话(这一步如果准备</p><p class=\"ws-p\">了一千级炼药，那么请一直等待直到提示你找到了一株紫阳花如果没一千级炼药不影响后续任何好人线步骤)</p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/IGJkbJH0ioR7VFx2uZecW08En9c.jpg\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"446\" height=\"92\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/CXGgbsI6qoRaYcxxaJrcM5lUnqg.jpg\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"447\" height=\"128\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">当对话提示至似乎走远了时，停止采药，往北走一步，弹出如下对话后点击<span class=\"is-bold\">出发</span>，出现新的剧情点，此 时程灵素和你说拜拜咯~不要你咯</p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/HIpsbCZQ4o6XMVxe8LScik2uneb.jpg\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"447\" height=\"104\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/HzKfb6kovo6Ldnx96kzcoCAFnNg.jpg\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"446\" height=\"259\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">随后玩家来到谷口<span class=\"is-bold\">(为防止之后出任何差错，请都不要击杀任何NPC)</span>，一路向北到山谷尽头</p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/VwcvbGRHsoiDZ2x4MmycZ9gQnMg.jpg\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"443\" height=\"75\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/RdRabS94poy5TsxuVc8cc8U5n6f.jpg\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"448\" height=\"88\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">进入东侧墓园出现新剧情：</p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/AWPCbrgAtoZA2dxuVrkcJUXEncb.jpg\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"443\" height=\"178\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">至此结束，可重新点击江湖，进入药王谷一路向北至残破古庙对话程灵素给他药材达到3000好感度后可 以拐回家（好人线奖励目前探索为可拐跑程灵素</p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/URUhbwGJpojC0oxhhlrc9CqOn7d.jpg\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"443\" height=\"103\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/NYpEbLobjovoElxUnBOcQJsdnvd.png\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"334\" height=\"63\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">ps：没程灵素的还得先好人线拐跑程灵素之后学一千炼药嗷(炼药等级是为了采花)</p><p class=\"ws-p\">如果你在上述好人线完成且有一千炼药后，重新点击进入药王谷走到松木亭后，仍然是等待程灵素对 话，点击出发，继续流程即可</p><p class=\"ws-p\">此时位于松木亭等待程灵素对话</p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/KqTjbnSZnoCCovxegRScv9WZnYg.jpg\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"444\" height=\"97\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/HjXDb49VJow7Jaxv1EbcJBhknVh.jpg\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"449\" height=\"76\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">点击出发后进入古林：</p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/WR8fbytUGoXadDxOv79cAgOgnGh.jpg\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"447\" height=\"102\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">此时就可以瞎走了，乱走一通，等待程灵素对话直至出现：<span class=\"is-bold\">你来带路</span></p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/JE5dbUKfGonF5qxsk43clS9antd.jpg\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"447\" height=\"264\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">点击你来带路弹出下一个剧情：</p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/KG6DbwosionDynxCzTicUw95nee.jpg\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"444\" height=\"97\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">玩家目前处于此地图：</p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/GU7xbJa7EoLg2KxLqI0cxLCSngh.jpg\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"446\" height=\"89\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><div class=\"ws-grid\"><div class=\"ws-col\" style=\"flex:33 1 0\"><p class=\"ws-p\">点击进入<span class=\"is-bold\">古药林</span>，此时动作栏有采药，点击采药即</p></div><div class=\"ws-col\" style=\"flex:33 1 0\"><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/YDIEbwzFLoePd7xUbtUcTLqcnCh.png\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"45\" height=\"33\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></div><div class=\"ws-col\" style=\"flex:33 1 0\"><p class=\"ws-p\">，如果在好人线已经采到紫阳花了，那么在出现传来说话声后直接点击停止采药，如果你之前没采药，那么就一直等到采到药了之后，退出副</p></div></div><p class=\"ws-p\">本，再从杀人线再度重新做到这一步，因为后续必须要紫阳花</p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/J66QbO2yOoN88YxLLoccWOennxc.png\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"304\" height=\"52\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">此时等到传来说话声，点击停止采药，向北一步至古林见到上官云药王谷弟子，全部杀掉他们</p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/ZAvobcNHqoC1zHxbitxcoSfXnZf.jpg\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"450\" height=\"106\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">杀完三人后程灵素到你身边出现新对话，点击出发：</p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/JWIWbvFCBoxQ3fxzJgRcPc1anEb.jpg\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"449\" height=\"67\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">此时程灵素会带你行走到谷口：</p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/XCbwbdi2ro0VT7xk4DocGuVkn0f.jpg\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"446\" height=\"280\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/BJAXbnNBQoWRYpxT0FMcDbojnUb.jpg\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"445\" height=\"79\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">向北行至药王殿柳伯提示你前往会客厅，向东进入<span class=\"is-bold\">会客厅</span></p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/BYt1bniLgo1BokxTg7AcHpJPnZ7.png\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"344\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">进入会客厅后等待出现提示：你听到殿后传来几声厉啸，管家闻声急忙赶了过去。</p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/ESfgbMRQVou6s4xqvh3cYuoBn1b.png\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"320\" height=\"41\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">上述提示出现后一直向西到<span class=\"is-bold\">丹房</span>，动作栏点击<span class=\"is-bold\">紫铜炼丹炉</span>放入紫阳花后地图出现<span class=\"is-bold\">地火窟</span></p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/TZC5bxx17oBgjox6icOcUgiOn1c.jpg\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"446\" height=\"104\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><div class=\"ws-grid\"><div class=\"ws-col\" style=\"flex:50 1 0\"><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/XUH7bVzUuozykmxhMaPcCd8InWY.png\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"163\" height=\"59\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></div><div class=\"ws-col\" style=\"flex:50 1 0\"><p class=\"ws-p\">前往地火窟前，请装备好你的内附伤害技能，带好喜宴回血或者回血技能，斗转星移等，准备完毕后前往<span class=\"is-bold\">地火窟</span>，向西北行走一步前往<span class=\"is-bold\">古皇坟</span>；动作栏出现<span class=\"is-bold\">无字墓碑</span></p></div></div><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/PvdcbJcwwo7xFvxLBm0c3eJkn4f.jpg\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"447\" height=\"82\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/V6vZbdceXowf1ax2BC3cJ9nrnnQ.png\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"81\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">点击墓碑，出现剧情对话了然后出现NPC残魂，击杀残魂，你的八卦拳派上用场咯<span class=\"is-bold\">（这个焚决是个梗</span><span class=\"is-bold\">，</span><span class=\"is-bold\">实际上没这个技能，不必再探索该技能的任何流程线）</span></p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/KGtAbwvObo0jHvxlAbCcKAw7noa.jpg\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"446\" height=\"125\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">击杀完成后出现对话：</p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/ScmXbesuIoIXHlxtGGQcdBkCnXn.jpg\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"447\" height=\"34\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">随后前往墓园与程灵素完成对话后完成杀人分线</p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/Ek7ablnWyoDQ2Dx0ED3cnexnnyh.jpg\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"450\" height=\"89\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/Q6aYbvnTRosTpVxJEH3cx5ePnsR.png\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"303\" height=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">至此，杀人线完结，可在陈执事处购买对应物品：</p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/M04RbcyOvoVZNFxI5ZacPnPAnGf.png\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"363\" height=\"210\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">(我*你的为什么杀人线有丹方有装备，好人线只有程灵素)</p><p class=\"ws-p\">好人线你都当好人了你还想要啥，能拐跑程灵素不错了</p><p class=\"ws-p\">杀人线可以在陈执事处购买残页和装备，装备无要求，神农和青囊手需要药王级别能买，子午需要药圣级别才能购买</p><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/XBhHbLG8xoPoikxI9jIcKq5UnFh.png\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"363\" height=\"210\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">1、上述杀人线完结后可以去找陈执事拿药方学东西(每周可拿一次)，陈执事会按照绿蓝黄紫橙药方，只会给你你没有的药方，你学会的他不会给你，记住，是学会的，不是你包里面有的，你包里有的你得使用了才算学会啊</p><p class=\"ws-p\">2、药王解锁条件为：学会全部40个药方； 药圣解锁条件为：学会80个药方（每个等级有26种药方，因此药王只需要学会蓝绿即可，药圣需要学会蓝绿黄+几种紫）</p><p class=\"ws-p\">3、谷主解锁条件为，每晚八点第一个通过杀人线的玩家，谷主可以在管家处选择3个药方到鉴宝阁二楼拍卖师处，管家会给谷主三次刷新的机会，谷主在这总共三次的刷新机会里面选择总数为三个的丹方进 入鉴宝阁二楼(谷主玩家选好点的造福一下大家吧)，随后全服玩家可到此进行购买丹方</p><p class=\"ws-source\">内容整理自飞书《武神MUD2手册》· <a href=\"https://ucn595zz2fou.feishu.cn/wiki/M2nBwc2kriJotvkRcjWc0U1InXf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">查看原文</a></p>",
  "source": "https://ucn595zz2fou.feishu.cn/wiki/M2nBwc2kriJotvkRcjWc0U1InXf"
}